    "1. 手机打开 Palmhelm → 我的 → 连接，选中「这台 Mac」或扫码。\n2. 核对短指纹一致，输入配对码。\n3. 成功后令牌只存在手机上，这里可随时移除。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. On your iPhone, open Palmhelm → Me → Connection, then choose \"This Mac\" or scan the code.\n2. Check that the short fingerprints match, then enter the pairing code.\n3. After pairing, the token stays on the iPhone only. You can remove it here at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 手机打开 Palmhelm → 我的 → 连接，选中「这台 Mac」或扫码。\n2. 核对短指纹一致，输入配对码。\n3. 成功后令牌只存在手机上，这里可随时移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
