    "应用锁的回环端口，填 1024–65535 的整数；默认由应用身份派生为 20000–44999；仅默认锁端口冲突时设置，勿与直连端口相同。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loopback port for the app lock. Enter an integer from 1024 to 65535. By default it's derived from the app identity in 20000–44999. Set it only when the default lock port conflicts. Don't use the same port as a direct connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用锁的回环端口，填 1024–65535 的整数；默认由应用身份派生为 20000–44999；仅默认锁端口冲突时设置，勿与直连端口相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
