    "开发或测试构建不修改共享 Claude 审批钩子。请在正式版 Palmhelm 中安装或修复。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Development and test builds do not change shared Claude approval hooks. Install or repair them in the distributed Palmhelm app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发或测试构建不修改共享 Claude 审批钩子。请在正式版 Palmhelm 中安装或修复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后会把 ~/.claude/settings.json 的状态行换成 Palmhelm 的透传包装：原来的状态行照常显示，只记录五小时与每周两个窗口的已用百分比和重置时间。关闭即恢复原状态行。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the status line in ~/.claude/settings.json is replaced with Palmhelm's pass-through wrapper. The original status line still shows. Only the used percentages and reset times for the five-hour and weekly windows are recorded. Turning it off restores the original status line."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后会把 ~/.claude/settings.json 的状态行换成 Palmhelm 的透传包装：原来的状态行照常显示，只记录五小时与每周两个窗口的已用百分比和重置时间。关闭即恢复原状态行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，退出 Palmhelm（⌘Q、菜单或 Dock）不会停止 Bridge，手机仍可连接；下次打开 Palmhelm 会接管它。切换在下次启动 Bridge 时生效。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, quitting Palmhelm (⌘Q, the menu, or the Dock) doesn't stop the Bridge, and your iPhone stays connected. The next time you open Palmhelm, it takes over the Bridge. The change takes effect the next time the Bridge starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，退出 Palmhelm（⌘Q、菜单或 Dock）不会停止 Bridge，手机仍可连接；下次打开 Palmhelm 会接管它。切换在下次启动 Bridge 时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
