            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshots and other pasted images without a file are converted to PNG and stored here. The folder is readable and writable only by you. Cached images older than 7 days are cleaned up at startup. Image files you drag or paste are referenced at their original path. They are not copied and not cleaned up."
