            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Owner replies in group chats: 1 = send the reply text, any other value = send only the completion status (default). Member questions and answers are not affected by this switch. Ignored in standalone mode."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群内 Owner 的回复正文：1=发送，其他值=只发完成状态（默认）；成员问答不受此开关影响；独立模式下忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "群内可用的项目名白名单，多个用逗号分隔；默认不允许群内操作目标；独立模式下忽略。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed project names for group chats, separated by commas. Group chats can't act on targets by default. Ignored in standalone mode."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群内可用的项目名白名单，多个用逗号分隔；默认不允许群内操作目标；独立模式下忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "群面板可展示的现有目录绝对路径；默认或路径无效时关闭群面板；独立模式下忽略。": {
