      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex or Claude config folders whose limits to collect are listed here. Each folder is a separate account. Several folders for the same account are shown merged, and their limits are not added together. Restart the Bridge after saving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里列出要采集额度的 Codex 或 Claude 配置目录。每个目录都是一个独立账户；同一账户的多个目录会合并显示，额度不相加。保存后需要重启 Bridge 才生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里的仓库可以读取 Issue 作为派发来源；只读取标题、正文与状态，不会扫描整个 GitHub 账号，也不会创建评论、PR 或修改 Issue。": {
