    "钩子运行程序的绝对路径（Go 迁移期指向 palmhelm-bridge）：须本人所有、可执行、他人不可写；默认留空，此时用 Bridge 自身；无效时钩子安装或自动修复失败，并记 runtime_publish_failed。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Absolute path of the hook runner (during the Go migration it points to palmhelm-bridge). It must be owned by you, executable, and not writable by others. Leave empty by default, which uses the Bridge itself. If invalid, hook install or automatic repair fails and runtime_publish_failed is logged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钩子运行程序的绝对路径（Go 迁移期指向 palmhelm-bridge）：须本人所有、可执行、他人不可写；默认留空，此时用 Bridge 自身；无效时钩子安装或自动修复失败，并记 runtime_publish_failed。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
