    "默认关闭。开启并重启 Bridge 后，只读本机 Claude Code 登录钥匙串，首次读取可能弹出系统授权框。向 Anthropic 查询额度，不发送模型消息、不刷新过期令牌、不写回钥匙串；成功缓存 5 分钟，最短间隔 1 分钟。保留状态行的五小时与七天额度。补充 Fable 专属周额度与套餐；仅在返回有效数据时显示，不填入零值。": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. When on and the Bridge restarts, it reads the local Claude Code login Keychain entry (read-only). The first read may show a system authorization prompt. It queries limits from Anthropic and doesn't send model messages, refresh expired tokens, or write back to the Keychain. Successful results are cached for 5 minutes, with at least 1 minute between queries. The five-hour and seven-day limits from the status line are kept. It adds the Fable-only weekly limit and plan. It's shown only when valid data comes back and never filled with zeros."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。开启并重启 Bridge 后，只读本机 Claude Code 登录钥匙串，首次读取可能弹出系统授权框。向 Anthropic 查询额度，不发送模型消息、不刷新过期令牌、不写回钥匙串；成功缓存 5 分钟，最短间隔 1 分钟。保留状态行的五小时与七天额度。补充 Fable 专属周额度与套餐；仅在返回有效数据时显示，不填入零值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
